00:00:40.834 --> 00:00:45.585
Well these are your oxyanions,
meaning they are all these different

00:00:45.585 --> 00:00:50.945
species where there's a nonmetal
that's bound to multiple oxygens.

00:00:51.365 --> 00:00:57.035
Now these different species, they
always exist in the exact same unit.

00:00:57.510 --> 00:01:02.690
Meaning that this, let's say if I have
