00:01:08.510 --> 00:01:11.770
So every single time has the same
charge, same number of oxygens,

00:01:12.029 --> 00:01:13.809
and we treat it like an anion.

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:20.260
Now, the easy way to try to do these is,
first is, I recommend just memorizing

00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:25.850
